  "usefulExpressions": {"sourceImages":[9,10],"units":[
    {"unitId":"unit-1","printedPage":86,"entries":[
      ["What's your mother's job?","你妈妈做什么工作？",""],["She's a doctor.","她是医生。",""],
      ["Mum and Dad are busy and tired.","爸爸妈妈又忙又累。",""],["What can we do for them?","我们能为他们做些什么？",""],
      ["We can do some chores.","我们可以做一些家务活。",""]
    ]},
    {"unitId":"unit-2","printedPage":86,"entries":[
      ["What's your friend's name?","你的朋友叫什么名字？",""],["His name is Zhang Peng.","他叫张鹏。",""],
      ["He's tall and strong.","他又高又壮。",""],["He's also kind. He often helps me.","他也很友善。他经常帮助我。",""],
      ["Who's your best friend?","谁是你最好的朋友？",""],["Chen Jie. She's funny. She often makes me smile.","陈杰。她很有趣。她经常让我开心。",""]
    ]},
    {"unitId":"unit-3","printedPage":86,"entries":[
      ["There is a playground. We often play there.","那里有个游乐场。我们经常在那里玩儿。",""],
      ["There is a taijiquan club.","这里有一个太极拳俱乐部。",""],["There are many people.","这里有好多人。",""],
      ["There is a gym too.","这里还有一个体育馆。",""],["Great! Let's do some sports.","太棒了！我们一起做运动吧。",""],
      ["My favourite place is the museum.","我最喜欢的地方是博物馆。",""]
    ]},
    {"unitId":"unit-4","printedPage":86,"entries":[
      ["Our neighbour is a firefighter. He often helps people.","我们的邻居是消防员。他经常帮助别人。",""],
      ["He's a school bus driver. He takes us to school every day.","他是校车司机。他每天送我们去学校。",""],
      ["That's an important job too!","那个工作也很重要！",""],["Chen Jie is making the bed.","陈杰正在铺床。",""],
      ["In the kindergarten, John and Class One are singing songs together.","在幼儿园，约翰和一班（的小朋友们）在一起唱歌。","原图跨页排版，归属 Unit 4。"]
    ]},
    {"unitId":"unit-5","printedPage":87,"entries":[
      ["Hello! Mark speaking.","你好！我是马克。",""],["Hi, Mark! This is John. What's the weather like in Sydney?","嗨，马克！我是约翰。悉尼的天气怎么样？",""],
      ["Well, it's sunny today.","哦，今天天晴。",""],["It's only two degrees in Beijing.","北京只有两度。",""],
      ["It's raining now.","现在下雨了。",""],["We can't play basketball in the park.","我们不能在公园打篮球。",""],
      ["It's OK. We can go to the library.","没关系。我们可以去图书馆。",""],["It's hot and sunny here.","这里很热，是个大晴天。",""],
      ["Their children swim in the pool.","他们的孩子在泳池里游泳。",""]
    ]},
    {"unitId":"unit-6","printedPage":87,"entries":[
      ["Whose sweater is this, Mum?","这是谁的毛衣，妈妈？",""],["It's your dad's.","是你爸爸的。",""],
      ["Can I wear this new shirt today?","我今天可以穿这件新衬衫吗？",""],
      ["Yes, but wear a coat too. It's cold and windy outside.","可以，但是再穿一件外套吧。外面有风，很冷。",""],
      ["Which season do you like?","你喜欢哪个季节？",""],["Winter. It snows a lot.","冬天。冬天经常下雪。",""],
      ["I like winter too. There are many festivals.","我也喜欢冬天。（在冬天）有很多节日。",""],
      ["It's full of life.","（春天）充满生机。",""],["And enjoy mooncakes.","还品尝月饼。",""],
      ["Then spring comes again.","接着春天又来了。",""]
    ]}
  ]},
